    "question_text": "Prove by mathematical induction that for all positive integers n, n³ - n is divisible by 6.",
    "student_steps": [
      {
        "step_id": 1,
        "content": "Base case (n=1): 1³-1 = 0. Student writes: 0/6 = 1, which is wrong."
